{"Title":"An Act authorizing the city of New Bedford to grant a utility easement to the University of Massachusetts at Dartmouth","BillNumber":"S2894","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"S30","Name":"Senate Committee on Ways and Means","Type":2,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S30","ResponseDate":"2024-07-25T11:11:33.87"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"MCM0","Name":"Mark C. Montigny","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MCM0","ResponseDate":"2023-04-12T16:54:52.1066667"},{"Id":"AFC1","Name":"Antonio F. D. Cabral","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AFC1","ResponseDate":"2023-04-25T10:48:06.0833333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2894/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"Senate, July 25, 2024 -- The committee on Senate Ways and Means, to whom was referred the Senate Bill authorizing the city of New Bedford to grant a utility easement to the University of Massachusetts at Dartmouth. (Senate, No. 2412),- reports, recommending that the same ought to pass with an amendment entitled \"An Act authorizing the city of New Bedford to grant a utility easement to the University of Massachusetts at Dartmouth\"  (Senate, No. 2894).","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. (a) The city of New Bedford may grant an easement to the University of Massachusetts at Dartmouth for the installation and maintenance of underground utilities under a portion of the land owned by the city at Fort Taber park. The portion of the land over which an easement may be granted and under which utilities are installed is shown on a plan of land entitled “Utility as Built Plan UMASS DARTMOUTH SMAST ii, 760 S. RODNEY FRENCH BLVD DARTMOUTH, MA,” prepared for Bond Brothers by Brennan Consulting and dated 03/09/2018.\r\n\t(b) As a condition for the granting of the easement and permitting the installation and maintenance of underground utilities pursuant to subsection (a), the University of Massachusetts at Dartmouth shall restore the surface above the installed utilities, including all paths and other park infrastructure altered by the installation, and the land shall continue to be used for park purposes.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[{"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Branch":"Senate","RollCallNumber":248,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Branches/Senate/RollCalls/248"}],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable with Amendment","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H34","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H34"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[{"AmendmentNumber":"1","ParentBillNumber":"S2894","Branch":"House","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2894/Branches/House/Amendments/1/"}]}